WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:15.860
<i>I feel it.</i>

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:20.120
<i>I feel my blood flowing into Ogata.</i>

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:22.830
<i>Ogata and I are...</i>

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:26.330
<i>Being connected.</i>

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:38.510
Are you the one who contacted us?

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:40.720
Yes. I'm Ogata's classmate.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.020
What is Sayaka's condition?

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:46.560
They finished the operation,
and she's no longer at risk.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.860
But we can't let our guard down just yet.

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:51.820
I see.

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:54.030
What happened?

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:55.820
Why was she...

00:01:57.110 --> 00:01:58.160
Gai Ogata.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:01:59.280
Gai?

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.240
But Gai should be dead.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.040
No, he's alive.

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:10.540
Gai isn't the same Gai he used to be.

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:12.500
He...

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:15.210
He did this to Ogata.

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:18.800
No way.

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:21.430
You mean Gai did this?

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:32.520
<i>Gai... I'll never forgive you for this.</i>

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:36.030
<i>No matter what happens to me.</i>

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:39.490
I can't believe this.

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:42.530
Why... Why would Gai do this?

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:47.450
Gai has lost to the evil of the Shiryu.

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.250
This is my fault.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:55.960
It was a mistake
to give Gai the Shiryu after all.

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:02.390
It flew!

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:08.930
Wow, you're in a good mood.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.980
We were so worried
after you suddenly disappeared.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:13.310
It's okay.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.860
She came back safe and sound.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:20.070
Rie, what's with that?

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.110
What was it again?

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:27.490
I-It healed!

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:28.410
Wow!

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:31.580
Rie, I'm not sure what happened,
but did you power up?

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.250
You think so?

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.750
I guess I'm awesome!

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:39.090
Is this Matoba?

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:42.930
Yes, Rie has returned to the hospital.

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:45.140
Yes, she's fine.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:48.180
Yes, I understand.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:50.890
We'll be waiting.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:56.400
So...

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:58.820
How would you like it?

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:05.490
I'm thinking of something short,
and a cute style.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:06.410
Roger.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:09.410
I see it!

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:12.250
The ultimate beauty sleeping within you...

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:15.210
I'll bring it out!

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.470
You haven't lived a good life, have you?

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:28.050
I can tell by the condition of your hair.

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:31.350
There's no shimmer to it.
Split ends all over.

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:33.770
Hair is a woman's life.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:39.480
And you can't take care of that life
because you lack self-discipline.

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:42.240
How sad.

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:45.740
Wh-Why... I can feel it.

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.950
S-Scold me more.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:50.290
Your hair is crying.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.540
Can you not hear it?

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:55.080
One hundred thousand strands of hair.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.580
One hundred thousand cries.

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:00.420
You should be ashamed.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:05.590
I-I'm sorry. It feels so good.

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:07.510
<i>This is it.</i>

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:11.720
<i>This is what I should be doing in life.</i>

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:13.930
<i>Screw the Shoshidai.</i>

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:17.480
<i>Staying in that place
<i>would get me killed a thousand times.</i></i>

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:22.980
<i>I don't need to deal with them.
<i>I'm going to live the way I want.</i></i>

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.240
Venus Style, complete.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.160
I-It's wonderful.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:35.910
It's great you came back, Issei.

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:41.460
Some folks would call you a genius,
so I'd love to advertise your comeback.

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:43.420
I-I can't have that. No way.

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.800
Well, I have some stuff going on.

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:50.140
I don't want to stick out too much
for a while.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.760
Issei, could you handle #3?

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:54.060
Roger.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:57.810
So, how would you like it?

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:02.110
Yasuko Tanaka!

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:04.480
It's been a while, Issei.

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:07.070
How did you find out?

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:09.450
I thought this might happen,

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:13.830
so I bought up all the salons in Japan
and set up my own information network.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:17.960
I have so much money
that my assets rival the country itself.

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:19.920
Do you understand now?

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.840
We're tied together with destiny.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:26.130
Now, Issei. Come on.

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:28.340
Kiss!

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:34.720
No!

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:37.810
I'm not letting you get away!

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:40.150
Gallon Hammer!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:55.660
N-No way!

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:56.910
Nebestigma!

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.120
Kiss--

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:07.630
Hey, Rie, get a hold of yourself!

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:08.880
Rie!

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.050
What's gotten into her all of sudden?

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:13.260
She was so cheerful until just now.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:22.270
Rie, hey!

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:23.900
N-No...

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:27.400
Get away, now...

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.320
Run!

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:32.990
Wh-What's going on?

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.070
What? Th-This is...

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:14.820
Did the Maldicion pass the critical point?

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:21.160
<i>Thank goodness. Rie's back.</i>

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:24.670
<i>I won't let anything bad happen
<i>to her anymore.</i></i>

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:27.170
<i>To Rie or Ogata!</i>

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:51.940
Doctor?

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.540
Wh-What's...

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:08.250
Is there another Busoma?

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:09.840
Rie!

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:22.180
Rie!

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:34.610
<i>Man, today really sucked.</i>

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:41.620
<i>What can I do to get away
<i>from that woman?</i></i>

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.510
<i>Th-This woman...</i>

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:56.420
<i>I-It has to be!</i>

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:59.300
<i>The girl with the golden hair.</i>

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:08.020
<i>This is...</i>

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:11.440
<i>Gin, lime juice, and simple syrup.</i>

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:13.440
<i>A gimlet?</i>

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:16.490
<i>A gimlet signifies...</i>

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:20.200
<i>A long goodbye.</i>

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:23.950
<i>Is she going to kill me?</i>

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:29.620
I saw your battle
with Zsoltgewinn earlier.

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:31.750
You've grown.

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:36.170
You have the right to fight me now.

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:40.390
What's wrong? Are you scared?

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:42.760
You want to defeat me, right?

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:47.270
You haven't forgotten this face, have you?

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:51.230
<i>I-I’ve never forgotten,
<i>not for an instant.</i></i>

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:55.730
<i>B-But can I beat her the way I am now?</i>

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.490
<i>This is straight sherry!</i>

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.200
It means,

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:07.620
"I'll give you everything tonight!"

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:11.000
You won't be getting
any sleep tonight, Issei!

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:17.460
No!

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.720
Wh-What an awful day.

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:25.140
Th-This is the worst day of my life.

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:27.470
Why did you run?

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:32.850
Did you forget?
I killed your little sister.

00:11:58.130 --> 00:11:58.960
<i>So beautiful.</i>

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:01.970
<i>The most beautiful hair in the world.</i>

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:05.180
<i>Like it's filled with moondrops.</i>

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:09.720
Why am I being entranced?

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:12.980
She killed my sister!

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.610
Issei!

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:19.110
Issei, why are you so embarrassed?

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:25.530
You're panting. Are you horny?

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:30.500
It's okay. My body is yours to take!

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:32.330
No way!

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:34.250
Knock it off!

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:37.790
There's no way.
I have a proper girlfriend!

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:41.170
Look! She's pretty, right?
I'll introduce you.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:43.170
This perfect hip-waist ratio,

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.300
the perfect height,

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:47.800
the perfect sparkle in her eyes.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:53.270
And golden hair
like from the age of myths!

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:56.900
<i>Wh-What am I doing?</i>

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:59.070
<i>She killed my sister!</i>

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:02.070
Your girlfriend, huh? Is that true?

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:07.450
Don't get so cocky
because you're a little pretty!

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:12.330
I'm putting my life on the line here!
I'm putting it on the line for love!

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:15.420
Oh, so you're a Chrysalis too?

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:24.840
You were serious about what you said,
weren't you?

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:28.090
You love me.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:30.050
Don't be stupid--

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:42.690
Okay, we're gonna drink all night!

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:45.610
Sounds good to me!
Let's hit up the next place!

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:51.620
What?

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:59.460
What's wrong? You lost, miss?

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:27.320
You're not human, or a Busoma.

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:28.910
What are you?

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:46.760
Stop!

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:50.590
Gai, was it you?

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.390
Not only Ogata, but you hurt Rie, too!

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:54.810
You...

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:56.890
Gai...

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:02.230
I'll never forgive you!

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:25.750
I... I can't have...

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:31.970
Impossible!

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:36.390
I can't believe myself! How could I...

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:41.390
Why so panicked?
Your dream came true.

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:44.440
Your dream to love me.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:47.190
Shut up! I don't...

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:53.450
That's how it should be.
For us, fighting is the true form of love.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.790
I am within you.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:09.130
The other Shiryu.

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:11.920
You and I are the same.

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:15.760
Shut up! I'm... me!

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.480
<i>I can't beat him now...</i>

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:30.940
B-Brother?

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:41.950
Rie!

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:45.120
Wait! Rie!

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.550
Nebestigma!

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:56.300
I'll take revenge for Sanae!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:04.560
S-So beautiful.
Like the goddess, Venus.

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:09.820
Well?

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:13.070
Aren't I more beautiful like this?

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:15.200
<i>Crap, I forgot!</i>

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:17.570
<i>This is her true form?</i>

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:20.830
<i>Did I sleep with a monster like this?</i>

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:31.250
Yasuko Tanaka!

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:34.510
Did you see? That's who she really is!

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:36.680
Now, who do you love more?

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:39.010
Me or that monster?

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:41.310
Th-That's...

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:44.020
Which one? Make up your mind!

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:47.520
Don't hesitate! She's a monster!

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:50.480
Y-You. At least you're human.

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:52.530
It's close, though.

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:53.900
I can't hear you!

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:56.700
I-I like you more!

00:17:56.780 --> 00:17:59.910
Oh, you're words make me tingle!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:02.830
Is that your answer?

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:07.290
If you get in the way of my love,
I'll kill you!

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:09.080
Let's go, Issei!

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:10.790
Right.

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:12.300
Rie!

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:15.300
No! Stay away!

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:18.050
What's wrong? Why are you running?

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:19.340
Stay away!

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:22.680
I hate you now!

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:26.390
What are you saying?
What happened?

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.140
Nothing!

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.150
I can't take it anymore!

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:33.690
I hate you brother! I hate you!

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:35.360
I hate you!

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.950
I never want to see you again!

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:41.160
Rie!

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:53.840
This isn't even challenging.

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:55.800
Become a Busoma.

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:58.510
I killed your sister.

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:01.180
Let your hatred rule you.

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:06.180
Brother...

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:13.310
Hey, wait! You can't, you can't!

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:14.650
Wake up!

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:18.150
You idiot!

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:20.530
Stop it! You're fine with this?

00:19:20.860 --> 00:19:22.950
If you turn into a monster, it's all over!

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:30.500
Don't you want me, and this body?

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:44.550
You... saved my life?

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:47.600
Of course! Together, we're one!

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:51.730
I'll show you the power of love!

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:53.730
Gallon Hammer!

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:55.230
Gallon Hammer!

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:58.820
Gallon Hammer!

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:05.870
Let's run, Issei!

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:14.250
What power...

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:17.460
Is that woman even human?

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:22.470
They're an interesting pair.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:30.640
It's thanks to you.

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:34.850
If you hadn't been there, by now I'd...

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:36.480
What are you saying?

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:40.690
I'd gladly lay down my life
for the man I love.

00:20:42.490 --> 00:20:43.360
I give up.

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:48.160
Maybe I need you, after all.

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:50.950
Issei...

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:56.670
Now that I look at it,
your hair's actually pretty, you know?

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:01.050
Rie, where are you?

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:02.920
Rie!

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:07.760
Brother...
